            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed herein is a fixation guide device for positioning and inserting an intramedullary nail, comprising a frame including a first end and a second end; a compression device removably coupled to the first end of the frame; and the intramedullary nail secured to a nail attachment apparatus of the frame.</p>
